:E11:t::b:2:2:2::l:1:f:7\ncell:F11:t:Hours:b:1:1:1:1:f:3:cf:1\ncell:G11:t:Rate:b:1:1:1:1:f:3:cf:1\ncell:H11:t:Amount:b:1:1:1:1:f:3:cf:1\ncell:I11:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A12:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B12:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:C12:b:1:1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D12:b:1:1::1:l:3:f:7:cf:2:colspan:2:rowspan:1\ncell:E12:t::b:2:2:2::l:1:f:7\ncell:F12:b:1:1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G12:b:1:1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H12:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F12*G12>0,F12*G12,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b:1:1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I12:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A13:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B13:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C13:t:Preheat oven to 350 degrees.  Line cupcake pans with paper liners.:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D13:b::1::1:l:1:f:7:colspan:2\ncell:E13:l:1:f:7\ncell:F13:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G13:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H13:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F13*G13>0,F13*G13,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I13:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A14:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B14:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:C14:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D14:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F14:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G14:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H14:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F14*G14>0,F14*G14,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I14:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A15:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B15:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:C15:t:Combine flour, sugar, baking powder, salt, shortening, milk and vanilla  in a large mixing bowl.  Mix at low speed for 2 minutes.  Scrape bowl.  Add egg whites and mix at high speed until fluffy and smooth, approximately 2 minutes.:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:bg:3:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D15:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F15:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G15:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H15:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F15*G15>0,F15*G15,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I15:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell