hesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I20:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A21:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B21:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C21:t:Frost and decorate your vanilla cupcakes as desired.:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D21:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F21:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G21:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H21:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F21*G21>0,F21*G21,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I21:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A22:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B22:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C22:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D22:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F22:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G22:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H22:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F22*G22>0,F22*G22,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I22:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A23:b::2:::l:3:f:5\ncell:B23:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C23:b::1:1:1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D23:b::1:1:1:l:3:f:7:cf:2:colspan:2\ncell:E23:b:::2::l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:F23:b::1:1::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G23:b::1:1::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H23:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F23*G23>0,F23*G23,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I23:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A24:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B24:b::::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:I24:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:A25:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B25:b::::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:E25:t:Source - http\\c//www.cupcakerecipes.com/:b::1:::f:2:colspan:5\ncell:I25:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:A26:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B26:b:::2:2:l:3:f:7\ncell:C26:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:D26:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:E26:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:F26:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:G26:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:H26:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:I26:b::2:2::l:3:f:7\ncell:B27:b:1:::\ncell:C27:b:1:::\ncell:D27:b:1:::\ncell:E27:b:1:::\ncell:F27:b:1:::\ncell:G27:b:1:::\ncell:H27:b:1:::\ncell:I27:b:1:::\ncol:A:w:26\ncol:B:w:42\ncol:C:w:105\ncol:D:w:200\ncol:E:w:75\ncol:F:w:75\ncol:G:w:80\ncol:H:w:75\ncol:I:w:42\nrow:1:h:14.25\nrow:2:h:18.75\nrow:3:h:14.25\nrow:4:h:14.25\nrow:5:h:15.75