da:l:6:f:1:cf:2:colspan:4\ncell:F5:t::l:2:f:7\ncell:G5:l:2:f:7\ncell:H5:l:2:f:7\ncell:I5:t::b::1:::l:2:f:7\ncell:L5:b:1:1:1:1\ncell:B6:b::::2:l:3:f:5\ncell:C6:t:2 cups sugar:l:6:f:1:cf:2:colspan:2\ncell:D6:l:6\ncell:E6:t:2 sticks butter at room temperature:l:6:f:1:colspan:4\ncell:F6:l:2:f:7\ncell:G6:l:2:f:7\ncell:H6:l:2:f:7\ncell:I6:b::1:::l:2:f:7\ncell:B7:b::::2:l:3:f:5\ncell:C7:t:1/2 cup baking cocoa (powdered):l:6:f:1:cf:2:colspan:2\ncell:D7:l:6\ncell:E7:t:5 large eggs:l:6:f:1:cf:2:colspan:4\ncell:I7:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B8:b::::2:l:3:f:5\ncell:C8:t:1 teaspoon baking powder:l:6:f:1:cf:2:colspan:2\ncell:D8:l:6\ncell:E8:t:1 cup buttermilk (see note at bottom):l:6:f:1:cf:2:colspan:4\ncell:I8:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B9:b::::2:l:3:f:5\ncell:C9:t:1/4 teaspoon salt:l:6:colspan:2\ncell:D9:l:6\ncell:E9:t:1 teaspoon vanilla:l:6:colspan:4\ncell:I9:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B10:b::::2:l:3:f:5\ncell:C10:t:1 teaspoon red food coloring:l:6:colspan:2\ncell:D10:l:6\ncell:E10:l:6:colspan:4\ncell:I10:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B11:b::::2:l:3:f:4\ncell:C11:colspan:2\ncell:E11:colspan:4\ncell:I11:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:B12:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:C12:t:Recipe Directions:b:1::1:1:l:4:f:3:c:4:bg:1:cf:1:colspan:6\ncell:D12:t:Description:b:2::2:2:l:3:f:4:cf:2:colspan:2:rowspan:1\ncell:E12:t::b:2:2:2::l:1:f:7\ncell:F12:t:Hours:b:1:1:1:1:f:3:cf:1\ncell:G12:t:Rate:b:1:1:1:1:f:3:cf:1\ncell:H12:t:Amount:b:1:1:1:1:f:3:cf:1\ncell:I12:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:B13:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:C13:b:1:1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D13:b:1:1::1:l:3:f:7:cf:2:colspan:2:rowspan:1\ncell:E13:t::b:2:2:2::l:1:f:7\ncell:F13:b:1:1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G13:b:1:1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H13:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F13*G13>0,F13*G13,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b:1:1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I13:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:B14:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C14:t:Combine flour, cocoa, baking powder, baking soda and salt in a mixing bowl.  Sift dry ingredients three times. :b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D14:b::1::1:l:1:f:7:colspan:2\ncell:E14:l:1:f:7\ncell:F14:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G14:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H14:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F14*G14>0,F14*G14,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I14:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:B15:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:C15:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D15:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F15:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G15:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H15:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F15*G15>0,F15*G15,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I15:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:B16:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:C16:t:Cream together butter and sugar until light and fluffy.  Add eggs one at a time, making sure to beat well after each egg. :b::1::1:l:7:f:1:bg:3:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D16:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F16:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G16:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H16:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F16*G16>0,F16*G16,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I16:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:B17:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:C17:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:bg:3:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D17:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F17:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G17:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H17:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F17*G17>0,F17*G17,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I17:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:B18:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:C18:t:Add 1/4 of dry ingredients to creamed mixture then approximately 1/4 of buttermilk alternating until mixed well.  Mix in vanilla and food coloring.:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D18:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F18:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G18:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H18:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F18*G18>0,F18*G18,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I18:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A19:b::1::\ncell:B19:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2:ntvf:2\ncell:C19:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D19:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F19:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G19:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H19:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F19*G19>0,F19*G19,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I19:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A20:b::1::\ncell:B20:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C20:t:Fill lined cupcake pans 1/2 full of red velvet batter.  Bake in a preheated 350 degree oven for approximately 20 minutes or until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean.:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:bg:3:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D20:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F20:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G20:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H20:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F20*G20>0,F20*G20,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I20:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A21:b::1::\ncell:B21:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C21:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:bg:3:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D21:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F21:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G21:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H21:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F21*G21>0,F21*G21,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I21:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A22:b::1::\ncell:B22:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C22:t:Cool cupcakes in pans for 5 to 10 minutes then remove from pans.  Cool completely on wire racks before frosting.:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D22:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F22:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G22:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H22:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F22*G22>0,F22*G22,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I22:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A23:b::1::\ncell:B23:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C23:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D23:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F23:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G23:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H23:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F23*G23>0,F23*G23,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I23:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A24:b::1::\ncell:B24:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C24:t:NOTE\\c  If you don't happen to have buttermilk on hand you can try this simple substitution.  Place one tablespoon of lemon juice or white vinegar in an empty one cup measuring cup.  Fill with milk to 1 cup.  Let stand for 5 minutes then use in any cake recipe that calls for buttermilk.:b::1::1:l:7:f:1:bg:3:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D24:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:F24:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G24:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H24:b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I24:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A25:b::1::\ncell:B25:b::2::2:l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:C25:b::1:1:1:l:7:f:1:bg:3:cf:2:colspan:6\ncell:D25:b::1:1:1:l:3:f:7:cf:2:colspan:2\ncell:E25:b:::2::l:3:f:7:cf:2\ncell:F25:b::1:1::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:G25:b::1:1::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:H25:vtf:e#VALUE!::IF(F25*G25>0,F25*G25,ERROR IN FORMULA (TWO OPERATORS INAPPROPRIATELY IN A ROW):e:Missing close parenthesis. :b::1:::f:1:ntvf:1\ncell:I25:b::2::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:A26:b::1::\ncell:B26:b::::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:I26:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:A27:b::1::\ncell:B27:b::::2:l:3:f:7\ncell:E27:t:Source - http\\c//www.cupcakerecipes.com/:b::1:::f:2:colspan:5\ncell:I27:b::2:::l:3:f:7\ncell:A28:b::1::\ncell:B28:b:::2:2:l:3:f:7\ncell:C28:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:D28:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:E28:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:F28:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:G28:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:H28:b:::2::l:3:f:7\ncell:I28:b::2:2::l:3:f:7\ncol:A:w:40\ncol:B:w:41\ncol:C:w:125\ncol:D:w:125\ncol:E:w:50\ncol:F:w:100\ncol:G:w:50\ncol:H:w:50\ncol:I:w:36\nrow:1:h:34.5\nrow:2:h:34.5\nrow:3:h:14.25\nrow:4:h:14.25\nrow:5:h:14.25\nrow:6:h:14.25\nrow:7:h:14.25\nrow:8:h:14.25\nrow:12:h:14.25\nrow:13:h:14.25\nrow:14:h:14.25\nrow:15:h:14.25\nrow:16:h:14.25\nrow:17:h:14.25\nrow:19:h:14.25\nrow:20:h:14.25\nrow:21:h:14.25\nrow:22:h:14.25\nrow:23:h:14.25\nrow:24:h:14.25\nrow:25:h:14.25\nrow:26:h:14.25\nrow:27:h:14.25\nrow:28:h:14.25\nsheet:c:12:r:28:h:12.75:needsrecalc:yes\nborder:1:1px solid rgb(0,0,0)\nborder:2:thin solid rgb(0,0,0)\ncellformat:1:center\ncellformat:2:left\ncolor:1:rgb(0, 0, 0)